            <link>https://nuxt.com/blog/v4-6</link>
            <guid isPermaLink="true">https://nuxt.com/blog/v4-6</guid>
            <pubDate>Mon, 05 Oct 2026 23:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
            <description><![CDATA[Nuxt 4.6 makes Nuxt server-agnostic with nuxt/server, rebuilds typed $fetch, adds sessions, Vue Vapor support and new dev error pages, and ships alongside Nuxt CLI v4.]]></description>
