            <link>https://nuxt.com/blog/v4-5</link>
            <guid isPermaLink="true">https://nuxt.com/blog/v4-5</guid>
            <pubDate>Sat, 18 Jul 2026 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
            <description><![CDATA[Nuxt 4.5 is our biggest release in a while. Vite 8, Rspack 2 powered by Rsbuild, experimental SSR streaming, a stable error code system, a new useLayout composable, named views, and a lot of groundwork for Nuxt 5.]]></description>
            <category>Release</category>
